  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PF 11-613 Pacific Science for Health Literacy Project Cook Islands Phase II (A12982)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working with the University of Auckland to roll out the Pacific Science for Health Literacy Project across the Cook Islands. The Activity will&#xa0;embed the model nationally to support goals relating to NCD risk reduction, and cross-curricular learning. This proposal outlines a framework for the development, implementation and evaluation of activities. The Activity is focused on schools and providing professional development for teachers &amp;amp; health professionals.</narrative>
  </description>
